# Lithobraking: "Create a Lander token. Then you may sacrifice an artifact. When you do, Lithobraking deals 2 damage to each creature." The Lander is made before the choice (CR 701.7a), so it can itself be the artifact sacrificed: Bot1 sacrifices it, and the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) deals exactly 2 to every creature at once, Bot1's own Memnite (1/1) dying and Bot2's Memnite (1/1) too, while Bot2's Phyrexian Soulgorger (8/8) has taken 2, not 1 or 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Lithobraking
Island x24

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Phyrexian Soulgorger
Memnite
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Soulgorger.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Lithobraking.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lander Token)

[Expect]
